#
# File: 600-LIFX-udp-dport56700-out-req-accept.rule
# Policy: Allow local LIFX client request to remote LIFX server
# Called by: none
# Description:
#  LIFX LAN protocol used by WiFi lightbulbs (and Alexa Echo devices probing for it)

udp dport 56700 counter accept comment "local-to-remote LIFX/UDP/56700 request"
